			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 140340201,
					"content": "于是，「魔物」被击溃、「巫师」被讨伐…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德",
					"speakerSubtitle": "克洛琳德饰"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340202,
					"content": "在那之后，王城重新迎来了和平的日子。那些被蛊惑的王臣，也看清了自己犯下的罪…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德",
					"speakerSubtitle": "克洛琳德饰"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340203,
					"content": "有人记住了那几位英雄的名字，他们拯救了这个国家…当然，也有人一无所知地继续过着自己的日子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德",
					"speakerSubtitle": "克洛琳德饰"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340204,
					"content": "这就是「逐影猎人」。他们追寻森森鬼影，并将其尽数驱逐、猎杀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德",
					"speakerSubtitle": "克洛琳德饰"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340205,
					"content": "不论人们铭记与否，他们永远守护着这座城市，守护着人们的生活…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德",
					"speakerSubtitle": "克洛琳德饰"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340206,
					"content": "呼…这就算正式结团了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340207,
					"content": "嗯，你们完成了一个好结局。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340208,
					"content": "不错的故事。原本以为只是个普通的冒险剧本，但越到后面越觉得它设计巧妙，制作精良。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340209,
					"content": "特别是最后那场决战，做得也太逼真了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340210,
					"content": "呃…哈哈…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜维娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340211,
					"content": "啊…的确呢，没想到我们从「宝藏」中得到的武器，还有着那样的效果。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340212,
					"content": "对啊，它们在我手上发光的时候，还吓了我一跳呢。我刚才研究了好一会儿，但再没见它亮起来过。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340213,
					"content": "哦，这些武器都是道具，要回收的对吧？我先放这儿了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340214,
					"content": "芙宁娜玩得开心吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340215,
					"content": "当然，如果下次有类似的桌上剧团，也记得叫上我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340216,
					"content": "行，没问题。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340217,
					"content": "那我就先回去了，路上还想好好回味一下呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340218,
					"content": "等弗洛莱恩先生醒过来，帮忙传达一下我的问候。真是辛苦他了，从刚才开始就累得睡了过去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340219,
					"content": "你说得对，是挺辛苦的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340220,
					"content": "嗯，那各位改天见！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340221,
					"content": "…现在…总可以问了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜维娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340222,
					"content": "我觉得应该可以了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340223,
					"content": "这究竟是怎么一回事啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜维娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340224,
					"content": "…原来你们早就发现了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340225,
					"content": "啊哈哈…山洞里闭眼的那场…很难不被发现吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340226,
					"content": "我可是忍到现在才问的！因为克洛琳德你一副无事发生的样子，而且芙宁娜看起来根本没有察觉到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜维娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340227,
					"content": "看来，我们谁都不希望揭开幻想的纱幕呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340228,
					"content": "欸？你们在说什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340229,
						140340231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340229,
					"content": "你们在说什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340230
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140340230,
					"content": "什么！原来好搭档你也…！啊…抱歉抱歉，你现在捂起耳朵还来得及！干脆我来帮你捂！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜维娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340233,
					"content": "这…再怎么也晚了点吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340234,
					"content": "欸？你们的意思难道是…刚才发生的那些，不是剧本里安排好的桥段？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340235,
					"content": "不如说从一开始，这就不是一个普通的桌上剧团。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340236,
					"content": "欸欸欸？！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340237,
					"content": "…好吵…头好疼啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340238
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛莱恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340238,
					"content": "你快给我起来！起来！这究竟是怎么回事啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340239,
					"content": "啊啊啊！不，不要摇！我的头…！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛莱恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340240,
					"content": "弗洛莱恩一五一十地向其他人解释了事情经过…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340241
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140340241,
					"content": "我、我没听错吧？这剧本的后半段都是你们现场编出来的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340242,
					"content": "骗人很可恶，但弗洛莱恩编故事好厉害。克洛琳德的临场发挥也是！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340243
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340243,
					"content": "简直像魔术师上场发现忘带道具，临时创作了一段精彩的魔术一样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340244,
					"content": "要是我知道宝库有问题，可能早就怕得要死，转头溜走了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340245
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340245,
					"content": "都是小场面。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340246
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340246,
					"content": "你口中就没有大场面，但随便挑一个说出来都能把人吓个不轻。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340247
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜维娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340247,
					"content": "可能我习惯了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340248
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340248,
					"content": "呃…你的生活是有多刺激…难怪当主持人的时候，什么情况都应付得来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340249
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340249,
					"content": "至于弗洛莱恩…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340250
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340250,
					"content": "…我没有什么好辩驳的。我这就前往警备队，陈述自己所犯的罪，接受惩罚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340251
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛莱恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340251,
					"content": "我倒觉得，你受的惩罚已经够多了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340252
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340252,
					"content": "…什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340253
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛莱恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340253,
					"content": "虽然一开始被功利所蒙蔽，但你在决战中的行为，证明了自己是位合格的逐影猎人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340254
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340254,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340255
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛莱恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340255,
					"content": "对这座城市来说，你继续做好逐影猎人的工作或许更重要。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340256
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340256,
					"content": "可是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340257
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛莱恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340257,
					"content": "当然，你还是要带着钥匙，去向其他两位逐影猎人道歉，并且承担对方所提出的补偿条件。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340258
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340258,
					"content": "…我明白。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340259
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛莱恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340259,
					"content": "但除此以外…你已经在和我的「决斗」中，证明了自己的名誉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340260
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340260,
					"content": "…！行…就按你说的办。我…这就去归还那两把钥匙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340261
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛莱恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340261,
					"content": "谢谢你们。我不会辜负你们给予我的第二次机会，我以逐影猎人的身份起誓。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340262
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛莱恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340262,
					"content": "那么…后会有期。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "弗洛莱恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340231,
					"content": "其实我也发现了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340232
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140340232,
					"content": "什么！原来派蒙也没发现？啊…抱歉抱歉，你现在捂起耳朵还来得及！干脆我来帮你捂！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜维娅"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1403403,
			"completionStepIds": [
