					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340316,
					"content": "…娜维娅，刚才在「召唤」的时候，你说——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340317,
					"content": "啊？呃…啊啊啊！那、那些都是真话，啊不，是戏中的真话啦！你听听就好，别再让我重复了，怪不好意思的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜维娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340318,
					"content": "谢谢你那么说。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340319,
					"content": "哎呀好啦，咱俩谁跟谁嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜维娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340320,
					"content": "呃…不、不聊这个了！我走在前面，你们也要跟上啊！",
