					"nextDialogs": [
						140340321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "娜维娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340321,
					"content": "啊…她溜走了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340322,
					"content": "那我也就此告辞吧，今天收获了十分精彩的故事，可以回去和大家分享一整晚呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340323,
					"content": "后会有期。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340324
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140340324,
					"content": "嗯，改日再见。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340325,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340326,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}…若是你的名字不被人记住，你的旅途不被人歌颂，那么你觉得这趟旅途的意义何在？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340327,
					"content": "（……）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340328
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140340328,
					"content": "就算不被记住，和同伴们共度的时光或许就是意义。和同伴们共同创造的未来，也是意义。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340329
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140340329,
					"content": "…不错的回答。我记下了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340330,
					"content": "那你又是怎么看待的呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340331
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140340331,
					"content": "我吗…哈…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340332
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340332,
					"content": "「对于这个问题，那位逐影猎人没再说什么。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340333
					],
					"speakerTitle": "克洛琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340333,
					"content": "「就由这无声的夜色，来替她回答吧…」",
